# Resonance

id:world-resonance a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "Resonance" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/657c8d74d4ff6> ;
    oa:editorialNote "---- Puppis Democracy ----------------------------------------------------" ;
    oa:kind "system" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "TRAPPIST-1, which no catalogue this map loads carries — an ultracool dwarf far below the magnitude any of them reach. No distance is given here either, so there is nothing to place it by. Recorded and not drawn." ;
    oa:uncertain false .

